<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-St Gobain raised at Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-St Gobain raised at Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>French glassmaker Saint Gobain was raised to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;accumulate&quot; at Merrill Lynch, market sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>Merrill also set a price target of 1,100 francs on Gobain shares, which were up 0.9 percent at 865 francs.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
